# Room 8: The Bazaar. Open models: three stalls, striped awnings, bunting,
# crates, an easel, and a lane north to the Cathedral, which you can see
# from here. The Cathedral (room 13) is its opposite on purpose: this
# screen is low, wide, loud and has no door at all.
# Outlines first, fills after: a fill only replaces white.

